{"id":"18acd7d9fc1abdda","group":"27","path":"27/27-ex-pbroofgap.md","title":"三角形割函数的roof间隙","display":"ex-pbroofgap — 三角形割函数的roof间隙","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-ex-pbroofgap","aliases":["27-ex-pbroofgap"],"display":"ex-pbroofgap — 三角形割函数的roof间隙","depends_on":["[[27-df-pbroofrelax]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"13.6.1 and Application 13.1","source_printed_pages":"595","source_pdf_pages":"619","verification_status":"source-topic-checked-local-example"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-ex-pbroofgap"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-ex-pbroofgap</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-pbroofgap — 三角形割函数的roof间隙"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"723fde838d821737\" href=\"?note=723fde838d821737\" title=\"27-df-pbroofrelax\">27-df-pbroofrelax</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"13.6.1 and Application 13.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"595"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"619"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-topic-checked-local-example"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=3\">\\(n=3\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I=\\{(1,2),(1,3),(2,3)\\}\">\\(I=\\{(1,2),(1,3),(2,3)\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\{0,1\\}^3\\to\\mathbb R\">\\(f:\\{0,1\\}^3\\to\\mathbb R\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal Q_3,\\rho\">\\(\\mathcal Q_3,\\rho\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"723fde838d821737\" href=\"?note=723fde838d821737\" title=\"27-df-pbroofrelax\">27-df-pbroofrelax</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar x:[3]\\to[0,1]\">\\(\\bar x:[3]\\to[0,1]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar y:I\\to[0,1]\">\\(\\bar y:I\\to[0,1]\\)</span> 由下式构造。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f(x)\\coloneqq2(x_1+x_2+x_3)-2(x_1x_2+x_1x_3+x_2x_3)\\quad(x\\in\\{0,1\\}^3).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f(x)\\coloneqq2(x_1+x_2+x_3)-2(x_1x_2+x_1x_3+x_2x_3)\\quad(x\\in\\{0,1\\}^3).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bar x_i\\coloneqq\\tfrac12\\quad(i\\in[3]),\\qquad\\bar y_{ij}\\coloneqq0\\quad((i,j)\\in I).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bar x_i\\coloneqq\\tfrac12\\quad(i\\in[3]),\\qquad\\bar y_{ij}\\coloneqq0\\quad((i,j)\\in I).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\max_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^3}f(x)=2,\\qquad\\rho(f)=3.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\max_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^3}f(x)=2,\\qquad\\rho(f)=3.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left(\\bar x,\\bar y\\right)\\in\\mathcal Q_3.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left(\\bar x,\\bar y\\right)\\in\\mathcal Q_3.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>整数值按取1坐标数k为2k−k(k−1)，依次0、2、2、0。所示分数点给目标3。每条边的x_i+x_j−2y_ij≤1：当端点和≤1由y≥0得到；否则由y≥端点和−1得到。三边相加为上界3，因此松弛确为3。任何坐标在整数最优解中都既可0又可1，所以任何强持久roof证书的相应系数必须为0；常数majorant3给出一个证书。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-pbroofrelax","status":"resolved","id":"723fde838d821737","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pbroofrelax]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbroofrelax","status":"resolved","id":"723fde838d821737","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n=3$，$I=\\{(1,2),(1,3),(2,3)\\}$，$f:\\{0,1\\}^3\\to\\mathbb R$；$\\mathcal Q_3,\\rho$ 见 [[27-df-pbroofrelax]]。$\\bar x:[3]\\to[0,1]$、$\\bar y:I\\to[0,1]$ 由下式构造。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n=3","display":false},{"tex":"I=\\{(1,2),(1,3),(2,3)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\{0,1\\}^3\\to\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal Q_3,\\rho","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar x:[3]\\to[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar y:I\\to[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"f(x)\\coloneqq2(x_1+x_2+x_3)-2(x_1x_2+x_1x_3+x_2x_3)\\quad(x\\in\\{0,1\\}^3).","display":true},{"tex":"\\bar x_i\\coloneqq\\tfrac12\\quad(i\\in[3]),\\qquad\\bar y_{ij}\\coloneqq0\\quad((i,j)\\in I).","display":true},{"tex":"\\max_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^3}f(x)=2,\\qquad\\rho(f)=3.","display":true},{"tex":"\\left(\\bar x,\\bar y\\right)\\in\\mathcal Q_3.","display":true}],"bytes":1525,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-133","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-ex-pbroofgap|ex-pbroofgap — 三角形割函数的roof间隙]]"}],"outgoing":["723fde838d821737"]}